# all-go.env is the fixture for TestAllGoCutoverConfigLoads: every API_GO_*
# switch set to go plus placeholder resources, so config.Load must succeed and
# every *Mode field must read "go".
# 本文件是 T2 的「全量 go 配置」测试数据：130 个 API_GO_* 开关全部为 go，
# 资源变量全部是占位值（不含真实密钥）。新增/删除开关时同步更新本文件；
# 与 docs/refactor/cutover/switch-matrix.md、infra/docker/api-go-cutover.env.sample
# 的开关名必须保持一致。
